/**
 * /kernel/evidence/ — Evidence files + PDF export (REPORTS-15 + M22).
 *
 * M22 (2026-08-01) upgrade:
 * - Tags: custom tags per file + tag filter.
 * - JSON verification: download JSON + verify signed hash (demo integrity check).
 * - Batch generation: modal (sector/pack/count) + progress bar.
 * - Trace link: each file's Trace ID opens the audit page filtered by that trace.
 * - Certificate link: each file links to its signing certificate.
 * - Third-party verification upload: drag & drop an EVD file → signed check result.
 * - Tampering detection: "try to tamper" demo that visually breaks the hash chain.
 * - Retention information: retention label per file (e.g. "5 سنوات — PDPL م.21").
 * - PDF preview stays (iframe srcdoc demo), extended with JSON verification panel.
 */
